    "title": "Man in critical condition after shooting on Yorktown - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago CORPUS CHRISTI, Texas — Corpus Christi Police Department officers are investigating a shooting near the intersection of Yorktown Boulevard and Sun Valley Drive. CCPD Lieutenant David Saldana told 3NEWS that around 6:26 p.m., officers and medics responded to the 4000 block of Ranch Lake Drive in reference to a shooting. Upon arrival, officers located a white male in his late 40s who had been shot during a family disturbance at a residence. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
